{"publicId":"1c16af69-3b07-4a5f-be5b-7ea17d1c6deb","title":"Coddington团队确立首个双名法命名动物的新类型标本","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T23:50:01.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-10T23:50:01.000Z","digest":"Coddington团队通过DNA分析重新指定蜘蛛Araneus angulatus的类型标本，解决了自1892年Clerck首次命名以来该物种分类缺失的问题【新】。新标本采自瑞典波罗的海岛屿，经与Clerck原始形态描述（1892年）及2025年发表的该物种全基因组数据比对确认。此前的分类混乱源于双名法首次应用于动物物种时缺乏明确类型标本锚定，导致后续研究引用困难【新】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-10T23:59:32.365Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Coddington团队在 Taxonomy 期刊重新指定蜘蛛 Araneus angulatus 的类型标本","latestReport":{"id":"jwh38e2phly4rzbw09sk3iqa6"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fil-Oo32R3Ro","title":"科学家为首个使用双名法命名的动物物种锚定新类型标本","firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T23:50:01.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"jwh38e2phly4rzbw09sk3iqa6","title":"Coddington团队在 Taxonomy 期刊重新指定蜘蛛 Araneus angulatus 的类型标本","summary":"Coddington团队通过DNA分析重新指定了蜘蛛Araneus angulatus的类型标本，解决了自1892年以来该物种分类缺失的问题。新标本采集自瑞典波罗的海岛屿，经与Clerck原始描述的形态和基因（2025年发表的全基因组数据）比对确认。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T23:50:01.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"jwh38e2phly4rzbw09sk3iqa6","title":"Coddington团队在 Taxonomy 期刊重新指定蜘蛛 Araneus angulatus 的类型标本","summary":"Coddington团队通过DNA分析重新指定了蜘蛛Araneus angulatus的类型标本，解决了自1892年以来该物种分类缺失的问题。新标本采集自瑞典波罗的海岛屿，经与Clerck原始描述的形态和基因（2025年发表的全基因组数据）比对确认。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T23:50:01.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z","heat":9.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T02:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T03:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T04:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T06:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},